## Lucide icons

The interface icons in `src/renderer/index.html` and
`src/renderer/overlay.html` are Lucide icons, inlined as SVG paths rather than
loaded at runtime. Each carries a `data-icon` attribute naming its source icon
at https://lucide.dev/icons. The exact source is pinned by the `lucide-static`
devDependency.

Icons in use: audio-lines, check, house, mic, monitor, panel-left,
scroll-text, search, settings, shield-check, sliders-horizontal, sparkle, wand, x.

